Apple could have released a half way decent looking pair of glasses with a good camera in them and speakers and would have had another product selling millions.  They don’t even fully need the AI yet, just a buzzword for later.  People complain about Apple’s lack of innovation, well right now they are not even able to copy a competitor let alone innovate.  It is bad.  Tim Cook has to be on the way out soon.

Meta is so far ahead of them.  Right now AI/AR glasses are just an accessory addition, but it is the one product that has a chance to disrupt the whole phone market if AR tech gets good enough.  That is years down the line, but Apple better start acting and keeping up, tech moves fast.
